# 🚀 Website Test Automation

Automated website testing project using Java, Maven, JUnit, and GitHub Actions.

## 🔧 What this project does

This project validates basic website availability using automated HTTP status checks.

### Test cases:
- ✅ Homepage returns HTTP 200
- ❌ Non-existing page returns HTTP 404

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

- Java 17
- Maven
- JUnit 5
- GitHub Actions

